The plugin JAR (jmeter-web-insight-report-*.jar) bundles the following third-party
software, relocated under com.jmeterwebinsightreport.shaded, and the HTML reports it
writes inline Apache ECharts:

  Apache ECharts 5.5.0                    Apache License 2.0
  Thymeleaf 3.1.5                         Apache License 2.0
  AttoParser 2.0.7                        Apache License 2.0
  Unbescape 1.1.6                         Apache License 2.0
  OGNL 3.3.4                              Apache License 2.0
  Javassist 3.29.0-GA                     Apache License 2.0 (one of its MPL 1.1 /
                                          LGPL 2.1 / Apache 2.0 tri-licence options)
  t-digest 3.3                            Apache License 2.0

Jackson, SLF4J and Apache Commons Math are used at runtime from JMeter's own lib/
directory and are not bundled.

